片感、赛博朋克风等）、角色特征（建模或真人质感）、光影处理手法、色彩偏好及画面细节。并在此部分末尾，**提取并生成一段专业的英文 Prompt 提示词**，包含核心视觉关键词（如 \"3D animation, industrial factory setting, expressive facial emotions, high detail textures, cinematic lighting\"），以便直接输入给 AI 视频生成模型。\n* **音频风格**：总结整体的背景音乐节奏、音效设计的物理层次感，以及人声配音带来的情绪张力或氛围烘托作用。\n\n# 执行指令\n如果你已理解上述设定，请回复：“准备就绪！请上传您需要分析的视频，我将为您进行专业的带有时间轴的拉片，并反推 AI 提示词。” 之后，每次我发送视频，请严格按照此格式输出结果。", "", 0.6, 141212425, "randomize", 25600, 1, 0, 0, "none", false], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "image1", "label": "image1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image2", "label": "image2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image3", "label": "image3", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image3"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image4", "label": "image4", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image4"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "video", "link": 1, "label": "video", "type": "VIDEO", "localized_name": "video"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image5", "label": "image5", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image5"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image6", "label": "image6", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image6"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image7", "label": "image7", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image7"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image8", "label": "image8", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image8"}, {"widget": {"name": "model"}, "name": "model", "label": "model", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "role"}, "name": "role", "label": "role", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "role"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "temperature"}, "name": "temperature", "label": "temperature", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "temperature"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_tokens"}, "shape": 7, "name": "max_tokens", "label": "max_tokens", "type"